563
00:42:34,242 --> 00:42:36,377
[PANICKED STUTTERING]

564
00:42:37,628 --> 00:42:39,031
[EXCLAIMS]

565
00:42:40,248 --> 00:42:42,908
[PANICKED STUTTERING]

566
00:42:47,159 --> 00:42:49,416
[GASPING]

567
00:42:51,149 --> 00:42:52,561
Fear not, gentlemen.

568
00:42:52,733 --> 00:42:55,673
With the system we put in here,
nothing will touch that painting

569
00:42:55,697 --> 00:42:58,090
